{
  "intro": [
    {
      "text": "An order of the ancient Knights Radiant who drew artists, writers, musicians and performers, and who kept up the other Radiants' morale.",
      "revealedIn": [{ "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "49" }]
    },
    {
      "text": "An order of the Knights Radiant, bonded to Cryptics, who weave illusions from light and grow by speaking truths about themselves.",
      "revealedIn": [
        {
          "all": [
            { "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "17" },
            { "book": "oathbringer", "chapter": "2" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "description": [
    {
      "text": "Lightweavers use the Surges of Illumination and Transformation.",
      "revealedIn": [{ "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "prologue" }]
    },
    {
      "text": "Beyond the First Ideal, their Ideals are truths they speak about themselves.",
      "revealedIn": [{ "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "17" }]
    },
    {
      "text": "The order attracts people interested in art, intrigue, secrets and espionage.",
      "revealedIn": [{ "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "49" }]
    }
  ],
  "history": [
    {
      "title": [
        {
          "text": "The ancient Radiants",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "49" }]
        }
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Most Lightweavers were interested in the arts, and the order included many writers, artists, musicians and performers.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "49" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Lightweavers seem to have taken some responsibility for keeping up the morale of the Knights Radiant.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "49" }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": [
        {
          "text": "The refounded order",
          "revealedIn": [
            { "book": "oathbringer", "chapter": "2" },
            { "book": "oathbringer", "chapter": "77" },
            {
              "all": [
                { "book": "oathbringer", "chapter": "2" },
                { "book": "rhythm-of-war", "chapter": "20" }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shallan is a Lightweaver, bonded to the Cryptic Pattern.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "oathbringer", "chapter": "2" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vathah, one of Shallan's men, unconsciously disguises himself with Stormlight and becomes a Lightweaver.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "oathbringer", "chapter": "77" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "During the True Desolation, about twenty Lightweavers, Beryl among them, surface and join the coalition, led by Shallan.",
          "revealedIn": [
            {
              "all": [
                { "book": "oathbringer", "chapter": "2" },
                { "book": "rhythm-of-war", "chapter": "20" }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "mechanics": [
    {
      "title": [
        {
          "text": "Powers",
          "revealedIn": [
            { "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "prologue" },
            {
              "all": [
                { "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "prologue" },
                { "book": "rhythm-of-war", "chapter": "39" }
              ]
            },
            { "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "49" },
            { "book": "way-of-kings", "chapter": "7" },
            { "book": "oathbringer", "chapter": "77" }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Illumination crafts illusions by weaving light and sound.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "prologue" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "Transformation, or Soulcasting, can change an object into one of the Ten Essences. To Soulcast, a Lightweaver looks into the Cognitive Realm and speaks with the object's Cognitive aspect.",
          "revealedIn": [
            {
              "all": [
                { "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "prologue" },
                { "book": "rhythm-of-war", "chapter": "39" }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Before the Recreance, Lightweavers were known for mnemonic abilities described as \"strange and varied\".",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "49" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shallan can fix a scene in her memory, a Memory, and then draw it with remarkable accuracy.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "way-of-kings", "chapter": "7" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "Like most Radiants, Lightweavers have squires.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "oathbringer", "chapter": "77" }]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
